848	     * The fixed list of public holidays that are not business days. A registration date that lands
849	     * on one of these is rolled forward by {@link #businessDay(LocalDate)} to the next non-holiday
850	     * business day, exactly as it is rolled forward off a weekend.
851	     */
852	    private static final Set<LocalDate> PUBLIC_HOLIDAYS = Set.of(
853	        LocalDate.of(2026, 1, 1),
854	        LocalDate.of(2026, 1, 26),
855	        LocalDate.of(2026, 4, 25),
856	        LocalDate.of(2026, 12, 25),
857	        LocalDate.of(2026, 12, 28));
